1
00:00:00,362 --> 00:00:03,472
(Leonard:)Okay, I'm hanging up now.

2
00:00:03,632 --> 00:00:05,202
(Leonard:)You know there's
no such thing as a--

3
00:00:08,103 --> 00:00:09,813
(Sheldon:)No!

4
00:00:11,774 --> 00:00:14,614
Penny! Penny! Penny!

5
00:00:16,312 --> 00:00:17,622
(Penny:)What's the matter?

6
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,760
(Sheldon:)Um...

7
00:00:19,949 --> 00:00:23,229
(Sheldon:)Well, I was worried
that you might be missing Leonard.

8
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,960
(Sheldon:)And that might be causing
you to have bad dreams,

9
00:00:28,123 --> 00:00:30,403
(Sheldon:)like the kind you'd get if you
watched Clash of the Titans

10
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:32,399
(Sheldon:)right before you went to bed.

11
00:00:33,796 --> 00:00:35,936
(Penny:)Sweetie, did you have a bad dream?

12
00:00:37,499 --> 00:00:39,499
(Sheldon:)-To be honest, I did.
-Aw.

13
00:00:39,735 --> 00:00:44,115
Back to the Future 2 was in the
Back to the Future 3 case.

14
00:00:44,273 --> 00:00:45,943
(Sheldon:)Leonard did it.

15
00:00:46,108 --> 00:00:48,448
(Penny:)-Good night.
-No, wait.

16
00:00:49,178 --> 00:00:54,288
(Sheldon:)Perhaps I should sleep here,
so you don't miss Leonard as much,

17
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,260
(Sheldon:)'cause you're being
kind of a baby about it.

18
00:01:01,957 --> 00:01:04,267
(Penny:)You know what?
That would make me feel better.

19
00:01:04,426 --> 00:01:06,096
(Penny:)-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

20
00:01:10,966 --> 00:01:15,026
(Penny:)Good night.

